Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translator: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:21.19,general text,,0,0,0,,People will gossip if you suddenly disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:23.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Death in front of witnesses
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:25.78,general text,,0,0,0,,will simplify everything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:29.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to save face
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:32.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope the death will be worthy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:39.88,general text,,0,0,0,,- Master!\N- Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:44.34,general text,,0,0,0,,What is he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:46.34,general text,,0,0,0,,- What is this?\N- Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.05,0:01:48.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Mercenaries!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:20.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:32.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I use your body with dignity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:26.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.07,0:03:32.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Holy shit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.83,0:03:40.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:41.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:47.76,italics,,0,0,0,,Shame
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:50.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Today he suffered even more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:52.80,general text,,0,0,0,,- Two more left?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:56.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow Cha Bum
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:58.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to see Uk lose to him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:00.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:03.23,italics,,0,0,0,,I'll let Uku win and be done with it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:04.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk would be happy about this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Dispute with the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:09.03,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to outwit him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:14.12,general text,,0,0,0,,UK loses, but gains experience
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:17.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:19.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Go to your room, I'll bring towels
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:30.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know who is the last one to fight him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:34.85,general text,,0,0,0,,but defeating Uka will not be so easy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:50.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:55.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is the owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:04:57.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you looking for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:04:59.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:02.21,general text,,0,0,0,,You are Mu Dok, probably
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.58,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- I see
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:08.63,general text,,0,0,0,,The one who is always next to Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:12.42,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,That heron that the maid Kim was talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:15.76,italics,,0,0,0,,I came to see him before leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:17.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Enter. A...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:20.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought snacks. Want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:22.14,general text,,0,0,0,,No, thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:33.78,general text,,0,0,0,,She is graceful and gentle, as the maid Kim said
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:36.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you standing here wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:39.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, look
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:59.07,general text,,0,0,0,,That guy did that, didn’t he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:01.83,general text,,0,0,0,,We should try it with a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:05.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you were upset about falling into the water
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.42,general text,,0,0,0,,And you assessed your battle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:11.75,general text,,0,0,0,,The first couple of times it was like this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:13.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just angry that I lost eight times
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:19.38,general text,,0,0,0,,You are used to walking around clean and ironed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:22.35,general text,,0,0,0,,and now you’re standing in wet and dirty, which means,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:24.85,general text,,0,0,0,,are you serious
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:29.65,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s really dirty
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.82,general text,,0,0,0,,You were in a hurry today
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:40.24,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no need to attack when he was defending
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:43.28,general text,,0,0,0,,It was worth waiting for him to weaken his defense
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:45.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:48.33,general text,,0,0,0,,If you took a step back after the blows,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:51.79,general text,,0,0,0,,he would relax and weaken
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.34,general text,,0,0,0,,protection
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:56.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Combat is a game of tug of war
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:59.51,general text,,0,0,0,,The enemy will pull you when he decides that you are weakened
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you need to attack
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:06.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the advice, master
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:12.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.06,0:08:16.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Swim and change clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:17.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I already smell
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.36,memories,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're looking for him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.91,0:08:30.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t go
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:35.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t go to your place, stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:39.30,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’ll bring clothes\N- Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:41.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I can go change
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:43.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Why overwork yourself like a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:50.39,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:54.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Behaving like a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:08:59.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:06.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:09.49,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:17.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:19.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:27.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Look at the shoes. All wet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:31.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:35.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you even follow me into the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:43.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you work unreasonably hard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.11,0:09:45.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Why try so hard with cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:48.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Rest, referring to me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:53.41,general text,,0,0,0,,The maid Kim sent dried ears to Corwin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:56.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat for yourself too, don’t leave everything to me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:58.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.67,general text,,0,0,0,,They treat me well because I am close to Dan Gu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:05.18,general text,,0,0,0,,heir to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:08.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Here's how
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:13.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I knew you were using power to your advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.07,general text,,0,0,0,,You are wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:26.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I fought for eight days in a row
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.45,0:10:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not the only wound
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:32.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Where else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:35.50,general text,,0,0,0,,We must go to Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:37.17,general text,,0,0,0,,There are still battles left
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:41.46,general text,,0,0,0,,We must suffer so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:44.55,general text,,0,0,0,,as far as my master is waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:02.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Feet will freeze
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.78,general text,,0,0,0,,You change clothes too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:47.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Done, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:06.34,general text,,0,0,0,,The medicine is bitter. Any sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:08.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll bring something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.35,0:12:21.56,memories italics,,0,0,0,,There must also be red jade
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:24.48,memories italics,,0,0,0,,They have value only in pairs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.19,0:12:27.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just throw it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:08.57,general text,,0,0,0,,What?..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:10.36,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:21.00,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:37.64,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Something beckons me with incredible force
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.10,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Inexplicable attraction...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:45.19,voiceover,,0,0,0,,It's calling me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:39.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- Damn it\N- That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:41.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Why was it necessary to pour energy into jade
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:43.54,general text,,0,0,0,,and so confuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:45.50,general text,,0,0,0,,This is quite offensive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:46.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:51.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I am offended that my heart beat so much because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:56.93,general text,,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.97,0:14:59.14,general text,,0,0,0,,felt it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.51,0:15:03.93,general text,,0,0,0,,My heart was beating so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.31,general text,,0,0,0,,- Oh...\N- Don’t say
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:12.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:14.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You're so surprised,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.03,general text,,0,0,0,,which means I have never used it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:18.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:20.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok does not have magic
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:22.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You couldn’t exchange energy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:23.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.41,0:15:27.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know this jade had such power
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:44.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:47.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.56,0:15:50.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I learned something new
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:52.81,general text,,0,0,0,,- Thank you\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:53.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think I should use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.36,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s unlikely you can
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:59.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok will not get it back
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:01.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I have two more fights
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:03.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll return it and use it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:05.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Save until then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:08.83,general text,,0,0,0,,And please,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.92,general text,,0,0,0,,don’t play with energy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:14.42,general text,,0,0,0,,You too
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:22.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:24.76,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Take you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:27.31,memories,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:30.23,memories,,0,0,0,,You will find a job here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:32.77,memories,,0,0,0,,I don’t want
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:35.69,general text,,0,0,0,,- Eunuch O\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:38.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Find out who is next to fight against Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:40.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:42.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:43.87,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Hyonggon Art
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:44.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:46.83,general text,,0,0,0,,how do you like the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:50.04,general text,,0,0,0,,With Chan Wook? As easy as shelling pears
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:53.17,italics,,0,0,0,,- Are you ready for yours?\N- Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:55.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I use Hyunggon, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:02.05,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,A magician from the Cha family who owns Hyunggon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:04.76,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He was watching Uk the whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:08.68,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,A coward who decided to fight only after Chan Wook lost
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.48,italics,,0,0,0,,Uk can defeat him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:18.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Hyonggon is a fascinating art
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:21.19,general text,,0,0,0,,But useless if you lack skills
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.11,0:17:24.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Cha Bum looks quite scary,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:25.66,general text,,0,0,0,,but this is just a façade
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:29.16,voiceover,,0,0,0,,So Yul reads others easily, no wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.66,0:17:30.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:33.67,general text,,0,0,0,,And he goes around telling everyone how easy it will be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:35.96,general text,,0,0,0,,defeat the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:37.13,general text,,0,0,0,,He's just afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.42,general text,,0,0,0,,UK has improved significantly these days
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:43.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Bom is afraid that Uk will defeat him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:49.10,general text,,0,0,0,,So my master has improved so much that he makes others worry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:54.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you so glad that Uk has become stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:57.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course. Pride straight to the skies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:01.48,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Nak Soo trains Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:02.65,italics,,0,0,0,,Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.53,0:18:06.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:08.70,general text,,0,0,0,,There is commotion in the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:10.74,general text,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:14.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Kang of Degantongun died of illness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:16.87,general text,,0,0,0,,But there are rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.67,general text,,0,0,0,,that he was attacked by mercenaries last night
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:23.84,italics,,0,0,0,,Uncle and Master Huo went to the funeral
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:27.18,general text,,0,0,0,,And if these are the same mercenaries as Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:41.73,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,The deceased Kang Man Jung
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.69,0:18:46.03,italics,,0,0,0,,Why can’t we express our condolences?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:50.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Our family transports expensive goods
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:53.45,general text,,0,0,0,,If people find out that the head of the house
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:57.25,general text,,0,0,0,,was killed by mercenaries, the family will lose their jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:18:59.54,general text,,0,0,0,,It was announced that he had died of a contagious disease
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:01.46,general text,,0,0,0,,So no one can enter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:06.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.51,0:19:09.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Are there any clues that will help find the mercenaries?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:12.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you performed an autopsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:18.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Kahn was stabbed to death with a sword before our eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:19.98,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no need
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:23.40,general text,,0,0,0,,His body will be burned tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.03,general text,,0,0,0,,So soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.61,0:19:26.74,general text,,0,0,0,,This is unfortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:28.66,general text,,0,0,0,,but we must hurry before rumors spread
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:32.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure Master Kan would like the same
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:33.79,general text,,0,0,0,,This is unacceptable
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:36.00,general text,,0,0,0,,If you cremate him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:39.25,general text,,0,0,0,,there will be no evidence of murder
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.67,0:19:43.13,general text,,0,0,0,,It's a family matter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:46.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand you are worried
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:50.30,general text,,0,0,0,,But the head of Sosnovy Bor doesn’t need to get involved in this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:54.01,general text,,0,0,0,,An autopsy is necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:55.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Postpone cremation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.18,0:20:01.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor has come to the point where it interferes with other people's funerals?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:05.73,general text,,0,0,0,,We do not interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:10.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to warn the new head of the house
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:12.74,general text,,0,0,0,,from an irreparable error
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:14.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you against it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:16.49,general text,,0,0,0,,What right do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:20.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Not long ago, the magicians were attacked by Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Now new mercenaries have appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:25.75,general text,,0,0,0,,There may be a connection between this case and the magic of Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.63,general text,,0,0,0,,So I'm interfering
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:30.68,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no magic
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:31.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I can confirm
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:33.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Where does such confidence come from without an autopsy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:38.47,general text,,0,0,0,,The head does not want to perform an autopsy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:40.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu, just shut up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.35,0:20:43.40,general text,,0,0,0,,We have the right to intervene,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:45.06,general text,,0,0,0,,if we are talking about magic
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.15,0:20:47.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you agree, Ms. Jin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:50.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.53,0:20:55.12,general text,,0,0,0,,this time the deputy is right
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:21:01.50,general text,,0,0,0,,The new head confirmed the death of Master Kahn
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:05.13,general text,,0,0,0,,And he has no choice but to hide the real reason
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:09.96,general text,,0,0,0,,No evidence pointing to magic
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:15.14,general text,,0,0,0,,So I doubt that Sosnovy Bor has anything to catch here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:24.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I just want to preserve the dignity of the master
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.27,0:21:27.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Let us continue with the funeral
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:53.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu openly neglects us
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:59.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Why were they so against it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:02.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- Strange\N- And also,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:06.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t think that Mrs. Jin would take his side
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:09.69,general text,,0,0,0,,She hated the stepbrother
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:17.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I was glad when you took my side
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.99,0:22:20.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Judge for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:24.33,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as we united, Sosnovny Bor had to give in
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:28.04,general text,,0,0,0,,How is the search for Boo Young going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:32.96,general text,,0,0,0,,We searched all the surroundings of the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:36.09,general text,,0,0,0,,looking for a blind girl of the same age
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.68,0:22:41.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I've been doing this for the last ten years
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:42.39,general text,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:45.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I think I know what happened to Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.27,0:22:50.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, a little girl washed up on the river bank
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:54.15,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes?\N- Only here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.07,0:22:57.78,general text,,0,0,0,,she was dead a long time ago
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:08.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother, I’m sure it’s not her
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:11.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I told my people to dig up the grave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.09,0:23:14.46,general text,,0,0,0,,If Boo Young is really dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.55,0:23:18.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I will bring you her body at any cost
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.97,0:23:20.51,general text,,0,0,0,,This won’t work
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.39,0:23:24.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring me my daughter back alive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:27.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Definitely, just calm down
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.56,0:23:30.52,general text,,0,0,0,,We will find her alive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.41,0:23:48.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Did you look at it well?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.91,0:23:51.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Your future mother and sister
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.92,0:23:53.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:56.17,general text,,0,0,0,,will they believe that I am their daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.26,0:23:57.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you dressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:24:01.80,general text,,0,0,0,,like Boo Young as a child
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.89,0:24:03.89,general text,,0,0,0,,But I don’t think Ho Kyung will buy it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.35,0:24:08.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Then beautiful clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.39,0:24:12.23,general text,,0,0,0,,will not play into our hands
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.81,0:24:15.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I must look pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.65,0:24:18.69,general text,,0,0,0,,She lost her daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.78,0:24:22.82,general text,,0,0,0,,If she takes pity on me, I will only win her heart
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:26.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.75,0:24:29.46,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right, So I
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.71,0:24:34.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I will definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:40.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I will become the daughter of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.69,0:24:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,You look better
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.98,0:24:58.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I recover quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.62,0:25:11.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Hyonggon Art
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.75,0:25:14.13,general text,,0,0,0,,elaborated
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.13,0:25:23.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I have suspicions regarding the death of Master Kahn
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:40.07,general text,,0,0,0,,He was strong, he was good at spells
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.15,0:25:42.82,general text,,0,0,0,,But he was already dying of illness
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.61,0:25:46.99,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no need to send as a mercenary
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.07,0:25:49.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone harbored a grudge against him
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.99,0:25:52.08,general text,,0,0,0,,and wanted to kill myself
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:53.08,italics,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.16,0:25:55.00,general text,,0,0,0,,We don’t know yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:58.79,general text,,0,0,0,,but there must be a reason for the attack
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:05.09,general text,,0,0,0,,When the soul passes into a new body, there is no need for the old one
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.68,0:26:07.72,general text,,0,0,0,,But getting rid of it is not so easy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:11.27,general text,,0,0,0,,In the eyes of people, this was a powerful magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.35,0:26:13.23,general text,,0,0,0,,official or merchant
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.89,0:26:16.52,general text,,0,0,0,,If he suddenly disappears, suspicions will arise
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.31,0:26:23.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Soo took care of this
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.11,0:26:25.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about the warrior of darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.49,0:26:30.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.66,0:26:34.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor didn’t even think that I was creating nomads
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.29,0:26:38.58,italics,,0,0,0,,When I hunted Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.67,0:26:42.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought she was crazy, who wants to prove herself
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.25,0:26:46.22,general text,,0,0,0,,So I never looked at who she killed
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:50.76,general text,,0,0,0,,That is, she killed those
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.51,0:26:53.81,general text,,0,0,0,,whose souls did Jin Mu move?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.89,0:26:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,More precisely those,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.39,0:26:59.48,general text,,0,0,0,,who was unnecessary after the move
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.56,0:27:02.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You said she was Cho Chun's daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.98,0:27:07.78,general text,,0,0,0,,So he took the little girl and made her a mercenary?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.57,0:27:11.99,italics,,0,0,0,,That's why I didn't reveal my identity to her
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.74,0:27:14.95,general text,,0,0,0,,and forced me to live alone in the mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:18.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Gave her no more than she needed to survive
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.54,0:27:23.46,general text,,0,0,0,,But she was determined and grew up strong
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.01,0:27:26.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.13,0:27:29.97,general text,,0,0,0,,She thought that this was how she was taking revenge for her family
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.05,0:27:31.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I obeyed Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.47,0:27:35.93,italics,,0,0,0,,She was helpful
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.52,0:27:39.44,general text,,0,0,0,,And then one nomad turned into a soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.10,0:27:41.40,general text,,0,0,0,,For this reason
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.44,0:27:44.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor suspected the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:47.90,general text,,0,0,0,,When Jin Mu found out that we were looking for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.74,0:27:51.45,general text,,0,0,0,,he was afraid that he would be caught
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.24,0:27:57.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Surely he sent her to Sosnovy Bor, knowing that she would die
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.47,0:28:12.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, bring some water
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.85,0:28:13.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:25.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, didn’t you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.77,0:28:27.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you to rest
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.82,0:28:32.41,general text,,0,0,0,,And what about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.49,0:28:34.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you to heal the wounds
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.53,0:28:37.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I went to Sejukwon. I listened to you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.46,0:28:42.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You can check
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.96,0:28:47.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Smells like wormwood
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.35,0:28:55.68,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:59.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I have fights every day. Just tired
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.32,0:29:07.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.32,0:29:12.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Did they rub you with warm wormwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.24,0:29:15.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm warm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.83,0:29:19.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Warm
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.67,0:29:27.46,memories italics,,0,0,0,,She was deceived and sent to certain death
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:29.51,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Nak Su...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.59,0:29:32.42,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I really feel sorry for this child
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.85,0:29:43.48,general text,,0,0,0,,You've cooled down. Let go
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.36,0:29:49.40,general text,,0,0,0,,- Have you changed your shoes?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.48,0:29:51.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you eat what the maid Kim brought?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.24,0:29:54.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Actually, I ate before you suggested.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.11,0:29:57.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Well done, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.12,0:30:01.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know that this stone could
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.50,0:30:05.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Jade yin-yang?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.67,0:30:07.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I only understood because you gave it to the prince
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.42,0:30:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,And what can he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.09,0:30:12.05,general text,,0,0,0,,- Show\N- I can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.13,0:30:13.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll show,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:15.93,general text,,0,0,0,,when will I return yours
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.43,0:30:18.72,general text,,0,0,0,,You will give it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.72,0:30:21.14,general text,,0,0,0,,when will you pick it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.89,0:30:25.31,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Won't you accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.98,0:30:32.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I will return it and put it in your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:35.53,general text,,0,0,0,,It has a lot of power
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.61,0:30:36.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Thankfully we didn’t know about it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.03,0:30:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You'll be surprised when you see
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.66,0:30:45.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of power? Show me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.50,0:30:49.38,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince fell to the ground, foaming at the mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.96,0:30:51.38,general text,,0,0,0,,It was terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.46,0:30:53.96,general text,,0,0,0,,That makes sense. He's from Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.05,0:30:56.05,general text,,0,0,0,,This could be a serious weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.74,0:31:20.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello, Deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:27.33,italics,,0,0,0,,Head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.41,0:31:30.54,general text,,0,0,0,,returned to personally observe the cremation
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.21,0:31:33.34,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you up to this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.42,0:31:36.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I came just to look
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.13,0:31:40.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Still, I see Master Kahn for the last time
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:42.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I am obliged to conduct it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.42,0:32:18.47,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Have you already seen the nomad,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.55,0:32:20.47,memories,,0,0,0,,so you recognize the blue mark
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.39,0:32:24.76,memories,,0,0,0,,Look if Master Kan has such a mark on his body
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.85,0:32:27.10,memories,,0,0,0,,Even if we reveal the alchemy of souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.18,0:32:29.35,memories,,0,0,0,,we don’t know whose body he moved into
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.73,0:32:34.69,memories,,0,0,0,,You have to do something to help figure this out
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.31,0:33:09.73,memories,,0,0,0,,I know that you have already mastered Chisa
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.85,0:33:12.85,memories,,0,0,0,,I wasn’t deliberately silent about this
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.94,0:33:14.35,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm not scolding you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.27,0:33:16.98,memories,,0,0,0,,What I ask you to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.07,0:33:19.61,memories,,0,0,0,,very dangerous and can deprive you of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.40,0:33:22.74,memories,,0,0,0,,But only those who own Chisu can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.82,0:33:26.95,memories italics,,0,0,0,,The nomad turns into a soul swallower when he loses energy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.70,0:33:30.12,memories italics,,0,0,0,,His body is still warm
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.87,0:33:33.17,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Pour your energy into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.75,0:33:36.34,memories italics,,0,0,0,,to make him wild
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.53,0:34:05.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.78,0:34:10.12,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.20,0:34:12.83,general text,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:29.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I will collect the bones, everyone stand back
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.81,0:34:35.73,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a nomad,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.81,0:34:38.98,general text,,0,0,0,,which turned to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.65,0:34:45.03,general text,,0,0,0,,No one doubts that magic is involved here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.41,0:34:48.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Can Sosnovy Bor intervene now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.12,0:35:00.54,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re not upset, you even tried to hide it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.13,0:35:03.59,general text,,0,0,0,,So you knew about it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.92,0:35:06.97,italics,,0,0,0,,You knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.63,0:35:12.51,general text,,0,0,0,,that this is a nomad who has gone wild
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.25,0:35:38.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Your skills indicate that
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.12,0:35:41.25,general text,,0,0,0,,that the soul of Master Kan is in this body
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.92,0:35:44.80,general text,,0,0,0,,So his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.88,0:35:46.97,general text,,0,0,0,,died in your body
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.05,0:35:48.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:09.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You are going wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.03,0:36:11.99,general text,,0,0,0,,devoid of blood and energy
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.24,0:36:18.50,general text,,0,0,0,,The more energy you use, the faster you turn to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.12,0:36:20.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:29.09,general text,,0,0,0,,You better not move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.35,0:36:37.35,general text,,0,0,0,,- Don’t kill him\N- Kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.87,0:38:25.21,general text,,0,0,0,,A feral nomad is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.71,0:38:27.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, Jeonbugwan dealt with him
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.08,0:38:29.59,general text,,0,0,0,,You helped us,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.67,0:38:32.92,general text,,0,0,0,,so you can take some of the glory
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.01,0:38:39.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.06,0:38:51.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Since we are due part of the glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.65,0:38:53.69,general text,,0,0,0,,we will take the body and study it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.15,0:38:57.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.92,0:39:12.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I closed his gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.67,0:39:15.38,general text,,0,0,0,,so that energy does not leak out
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.13,0:39:18.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring him back to life to interrogate him
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.22,0:39:20.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:25.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Consider it a breathing stone. Do you want him to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.56,0:39:27.02,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t be easy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.36,0:39:38.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid that he might be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.87,0:39:42.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Even so, they won’t succeed
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.58,0:39:46.16,general text,,0,0,0,,This would be possible with an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.66,0:39:48.25,general text,,0,0,0,,But they don’t have it
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.92,0:39:52.04,general text,,0,0,0,,So it can be revived with a stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.13,0:39:53.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.13,0:39:56.67,general text,,0,0,0,,And you have this stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.80,0:39:59.26,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to know
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.64,0:40:02.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Prepare the mercenaries
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.22,0:40:04.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find a way,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.85,0:40:07.39,general text,,0,0,0,,even if you have to move the soul into the body of the magician Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.48,0:40:16.69,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Bom\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.78,0:40:17.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.12,0:40:27.37,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Hyonggon Art
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.45,0:40:29.04,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Leopard head press stance
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.12,0:40:30.96,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Direct attack stance
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.30,0:42:05.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.22,0:42:08.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.60,0:42:10.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you going to training?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.14,0:42:13.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.89,0:42:14.81,general text,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.86,0:42:22.19,general text,,0,0,0,,And I fought
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.15,0:42:25.49,general text,,0,0,0,,with a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.41,0:42:32.54,general text,,0,0,0,,The deceased master Kan was a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.04,0:42:35.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.46,0:42:37.29,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.63,0:42:40.30,general text,,0,0,0,,If you hide the blue mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.38,0:42:42.55,general text,,0,0,0,,there is no way to distinguish them from other people
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.47,0:42:45.22,general text,,0,0,0,,But once they go wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.43,0:42:47.93,general text,,0,0,0,,no turning back
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.73,0:42:57.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Losing energy, they turn into stone
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.44,0:43:01.48,general text,,0,0,0,,And you can only recover by sucking out someone else’s energy
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.98,0:43:04.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Having done this once,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.61,0:43:08.57,general text,,0,0,0,,they turn into monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.79,0:43:12.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.01,0:43:30.39,general text,,0,0,0,,And our task is to protect the world
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.52,0:43:36.10,general text,,0,0,0,,from them
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.78,0:43:47.36,general text,,0,0,0,,We can protect these monsters from the world
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.28,0:43:50.91,general text,,0,0,0,,We'll keep an eye on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.74,0:43:53.62,general text,,0,0,0,,and there will be peace in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.83,0:43:57.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone has high hopes for you since childhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.58,0:44:00.54,general text,,0,0,0,,so you think you should do something worthwhile
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.63,0:44:01.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, they told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.21,0:44:05.26,general text,,0,0,0,,so I don’t stick my head out
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.72,0:44:08.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.47,0:44:12.26,general text,,0,0,0,,follow my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.83,0:44:42.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu let Pine Forest close
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.21,0:44:44.92,general text,,0,0,0,,What if they start to suspect the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.67,0:44:46.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Palace...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.96,0:44:52.43,general text,,0,0,0,,not a place where Park Jin can just break into, like in Daegantonggun
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.51,0:44:55.56,general text,,0,0,0,,But if he appears, I will be in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.14,0:44:57.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Since the death of Kil Ju
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.06,0:44:59.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t eat energy
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.64,0:45:04.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm going wild
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.65,0:45:10.11,general text,,0,0,0,,You can share with me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.03,0:45:12.61,general text,,0,0,0,,by the power of an ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.95,0:45:14.95,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.03,0:45:18.45,general text,,0,0,0,,The only one who can serve you, knowing your true face,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.67,0:45:24.33,general text,,0,0,0,,it’s me, don’t you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.54,0:45:26.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.00,0:45:29.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.71,0:45:32.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you not to address me like that
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.26,0:45:36.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to turn to stone as soon as possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.10,0:45:40.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I know you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.98,0:45:44.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the only one in the palace who knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.60,0:45:47.52,general text,,0,0,0,,that you are the shaman Choi,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.61,0:45:50.65,general text,,0,0,0,,migrated into the body of the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.07,0:45:53.53,general text,,0,0,0,,If I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.61,0:45:57.83,general text,,0,0,0,,can you transfer your sister from Jinyeowon here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.16,0:46:03.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.12,0:46:09.09,general text,,0,0,0,,a real queen in your body
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.13,0:46:15.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Should I stop visiting her?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.97,0:46:17.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.56,0:46:23.69,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s getting harder for me
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.73,0:46:26.65,general text,,0,0,0,,live in this body
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.65,0:46:30.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.94,0:46:34.78,general text,,0,0,0,,move my soul to another body
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.49,0:46:37.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.16,0:46:42.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.50,0:46:44.87,general text,,0,0,0,,You can go
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.94,0:47:12.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.19,0:47:15.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I will give in to you and it will all end
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.32,0:47:22.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I give up
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.74,0:47:24.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, Uk... Uk!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.29,0:47:32.84,general text,,0,0,0,,You wanted to leave before me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.92,0:47:34.17,general text,,0,0,0,,And you won
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.18,0:47:43.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu wanted to let you win
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.68,0:47:45.06,general text,,0,0,0,,How could you refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.14,0:47:47.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know you were so proud of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.60,0:47:50.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, you did something like this to make me refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.61,0:47:51.69,general text,,0,0,0,,When is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.77,0:47:53.61,general text,,0,0,0,,It was a look of relief
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.69,0:47:55.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Should have shown
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.11,0:47:57.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Like this
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.11,0:47:58.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I did just that
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.49,0:48:02.78,general text,,0,0,0,,And how was this to be understood? If I understood, I would agree
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.33,0:48:05.91,general text,,0,0,0,,One fight left
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.62,0:48:07.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.96,0:48:09.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you blaming me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.04,0:48:12.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You yourself gave him the jade, and are you angry with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.75,0:48:15.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you moving the arrows now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.38,0:48:16.84,general text,,0,0,0,,How childish
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.92,0:48:19.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Childish? Show really childish behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.51,0:48:20.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm giving up everything
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.59,0:48:22.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Should I behave like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.69,0:48:35.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Mages have been guarding Saejukwon since last night
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.57,0:48:39.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Surely the soulswallower’s body is there
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.57,0:48:42.32,general text,,0,0,0,,If he died, the body would be taken to the secret room
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.82,0:48:45.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Why was he put in Sejukwon, which is for the living?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.59,0:48:58.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to find out what happened to the body
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.13,0:49:00.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait. I'll inform the head
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.07,0:49:20.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that the head is in Saejukwon, so I came to see him
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.57,0:49:23.07,general text,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed into Sejukwon yet
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.16,0:49:25.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Then first I will meet with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.53,0:49:27.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell the head that I’m here
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.20,0:49:30.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu has arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.83,0:49:34.83,general text,,0,0,0,,check if the souleater really died
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.96,0:49:38.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell me to leave while we're still investigating
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.42,0:49:41.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Someone else has come to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.34,0:49:43.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him go
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.55,0:49:46.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t let anyone into Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.22,0:49:47.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.26,0:49:49.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I will tell the maid Kim to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.02,0:49:52.14,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.23,0:49:54.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.48,0:49:57.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I will tell her that the head cannot accept anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.28,0:50:01.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.78,0:50:06.20,general text,,0,0,0,,She can as an exception
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.88,0:50:18.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.56,0:50:40.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I stayed in the house of Gwangju Chang Gan when I served him,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.65,0:50:44.61,general text,,0,0,0,,and you cooked delicious food
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.74,0:50:47.20,general text,,0,0,0,,You ate so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.70,0:50:51.12,general text,,0,0,0,,that your rice bowl was the largest
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.25,0:50:53.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.45,0:50:56.62,general text,,0,0,0,,You had a really huge bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.71,0:50:59.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I was always hungry then
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.59,0:51:04.17,general text,,0,0,0,,You probably cooked something delicious again
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.76,0:51:07.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I prepared them myself
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.06,0:51:15.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Honey cookies. I loved them so much before
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.73,0:51:16.94,general text,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.02,0:51:20.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I asked you to convey Gwangju,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.11,0:51:23.15,general text,,0,0,0,,and you put a couple in your pockets
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.36,0:51:28.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Because I could eat\N only when he finished
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.86,0:51:32.99,general text,,0,0,0,,In any case, I gained a lot by following Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.08,0:51:35.12,general text,,0,0,0,,ate deliciously,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.08,0:51:38.54,general text,,0,0,0,,taught special spells
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.71,0:51:47.13,general text,,0,0,0,,They taste better when you eat them in secret, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.93,0:51:55.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.10,0:51:58.56,general text,,0,0,0,,sweets are always so dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.64,0:52:02.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Once you try it, you can’t stop
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.03,0:52:07.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t differentiate,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.16,0:52:10.74,general text,,0,0,0,,what you can eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.45,0:52:14.16,general text,,0,0,0,,and what not
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.25,0:52:19.00,general text,,0,0,0,,You hurt me by not allowing me to even try
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.00,0:52:24.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be so greedy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.76,0:52:32.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju really loved these cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.14,0:52:34.01,general text,,0,0,0,,And his son?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.10,0:52:37.14,general text,,0,0,0,,The young master loves them too
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.22,0:52:39.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you need to share it with him
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.85,0:52:45.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I can tell him a lot of stories about my father
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.74,0:52:56.04,general text,,0,0,0,,You and Uk have nothing to talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.12,0:52:57.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You can go
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.91,0:53:00.75,general text,,0,0,0,,He just wanted cookies. What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.46,0:53:04.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t let me share memories with him
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.71,0:53:05.67,general text,,0,0,0,,It must be,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.46,0:53:09.92,general text,,0,0,0,,again, you don’t want me to touch yours
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.76,0:53:13.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.76,0:53:17.97,general text,,0,0,0,,This is for the gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.06,0:53:19.60,general text,,0,0,0,,but you can take
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.14,0:53:21.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.14,0:53:23.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t give him
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.27,0:53:26.32,general text,,0,0,0,,If I really wanted to,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.86,0:53:29.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I would have already stolen a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.99,0:53:32.20,general text,,0,0,0,,But I'll let you win
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.66,0:53:38.91,general text,,0,0,0,,We haven’t seen each other for a long time. It's a pity to say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.80,0:53:49.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu used to take revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.13,0:53:52.01,general text,,0,0,0,,if he was scolded for eating
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.68,0:53:54.26,general text,,0,0,0,,It's just cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.34,0:53:55.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Should have given him a little
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.05,0:53:58.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I just don’t want him to eat that,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.52,0:54:03.31,general text,,0,0,0,,what you had difficulty preparing
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.15,0:54:06.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.36,0:54:08.48,general text,,0,0,0,,We haven’t seen each other for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.57,0:54:11.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's talk over a cup of tea
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.61,0:54:17.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.16,0:54:19.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You look tired
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.71,0:54:25.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.17,0:54:30.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll eat your cookies and immediately come to my senses
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.43,0:54:41.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.89,0:54:44.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I have an errand
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.60,0:54:46.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Order? Which?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.65,0:54:47.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Go to Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.06,0:54:52.36,general text,,0,0,0,,This is still wrong. Pass this on
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.69,0:54:54.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.70,0:55:01.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Did something happen in Sejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.70,0:55:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.29,0:55:08.79,general text,,0,0,0,,But it seems that this is connected with what happened with Degantongun
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.59,0:55:11.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that Jeonbugwan and Sosnovy Bor were fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.22,0:55:18.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Yul?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.18,0:55:19.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him since last night
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.97,0:55:21.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Carrying out instructions from the head, probably
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.14,0:55:24.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.85,0:55:27.14,memories italics,,0,0,0,,And I fought
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.27,0:55:30.69,memories,,0,0,0,,with a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.29,0:55:45.45,general text,,0,0,0,,We must strengthen the borders
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.54,0:55:48.37,general text,,0,0,0,,You are prohibited from leaving Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.29,0:55:52.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Those who own Ryusu and more,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.13,0:55:55.55,general text,,0,0,0,,go to Saejukwon and follow Sang Ho's orders
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.63,0:55:56.76,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.63,0:55:58.55,italics,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.89,0:56:00.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You stay
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.30,0:56:04.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone except Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.10,0:56:06.89,general text,,0,0,0,,follow Sang Ho to Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.98,0:56:08.27,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.82,0:56:14.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.86,0:56:17.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Why am I not going?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.86,0:56:20.66,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t need it because you’re not needed there
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.91,0:56:23.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there something dangerous there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.83,0:56:26.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there a nomad there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.79,0:56:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s none of your concern
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.62,0:56:31.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t even be interested
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.13,0:56:33.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding everything from me? I'm a magician here too
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.00,0:56:37.34,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the exception to all the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.92,0:56:40.72,general text,,0,0,0,,If you're bored, you can leave Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.80,0:56:44.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Go home and do what you like
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.85,0:56:50.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you for worrying
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.45,0:57:09.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.79,0:57:13.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Chwisonra and eat something tasty
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.63,0:57:18.09,general text,,0,0,0,,All the magicians in Sejukwon. Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.67,0:57:21.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I was told not to interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.22,0:57:24.22,general text,,0,0,0,,and that it’s not my concern
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.80,0:57:27.43,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let's go\N- Maid Kim gave me a task
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.14,0:57:30.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's go together. Where should I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.44,0:57:32.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.31,0:57:35.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go then
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.99,0:57:44.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you told her that you want another body
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.78,0:57:48.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you give it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.91,0:57:53.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I want the body of the girl who will join Jinyoung as Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.54,0:57:57.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Having been in the body of a eunuch,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.00,0:57:59.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t mind being in a woman’s body
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.51,0:58:05.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I want a powerful body, like a shaman’s
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.10,0:58:08.35,general text,,0,0,0,,"Shaman"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.60,0:58:11.93,general text,,0,0,0,,She was upset that you reminded her of
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.02,0:58:15.15,general text,,0,0,0,,that she was a shaman, a fortune teller
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.77,0:58:17.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t lie
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.82,0:58:24.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I was also reminded of how I asked for food and stole sweets
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.16,0:58:30.20,general text,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t a lie, but I wasn’t happy to hear something like that
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.05,0:58:43.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu wanted to eat cookies,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.30,0:58:45.09,general text,,0,0,0,,but Park Jin didn’t let him
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.72,0:58:47.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim was worried that Ji Moo would be offended,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.80,0:58:49.76,general text,,0,0,0,,so I asked you to give this to him
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.85,0:58:52.81,general text,,0,0,0,,So, they were arguing like children over food?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.89,0:58:55.64,general text,,0,0,0,,The chapter is sometimes so petty
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.73,0:58:58.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Arguing over honey cookies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.65,0:59:00.94,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right, this is petty
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.07,0:59:09.62,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Here in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.70,0:59:12.49,memories italics,,0,0,0,,we write down all the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.73,0:59:39.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I will tell the deputy that this is from the Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.98,0:59:43.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell him it's from the maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.90,0:59:47.24,general text,,0,0,0,,And also that they contain a lot of oil
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.32,0:59:49.62,general text,,0,0,0,,and should be washed down with green tea
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.70,0:59:50.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.87,0:59:53.49,general text,,0,0,0,,And there, of course, is honey
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.58,0:59:55.87,general text,,0,0,0,,They must be stored in the cold, otherwise they will stick together
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.95,0:59:58.37,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir\N- And since we brought them,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.46,1:00:00.42,general text,,0,0,0,,- can I go inside?\N- Yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.50,1:00:02.92,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Thank you. We won't last long
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.00,1:00:03.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.59,1:00:06.55,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.39,1:00:16.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to visit here
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.39,1:00:19.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Even though my father is Gwangju, I was not allowed here
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.36,1:00:26.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.45,1:00:31.03,general text,,0,0,0,,You were here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.12,1:00:33.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Your father was an astrologer here
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.41,1:00:36.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you come here for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.96,1:00:42.04,general text,,0,0,0,,You could have asked someone to deliver cookies
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.71,1:00:45.75,general text,,0,0,0,,But I came on my own because I wanted to, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.43,1:00:53.47,general text,,0,0,0,,As a child, my father often brought me here
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.60,1:00:58.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Even showed me a recording of the day I was born
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.48,1:01:01.10,general text,,0,0,0,,He was a good father
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.61,1:01:06.15,general text,,0,0,0,,If you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.23,1:01:09.32,general text,,0,0,0,,surely there is a recording here from your birthday too
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.70,1:01:13.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.53,1:01:18.04,general text,,0,0,0,,So, the recording from that day should be here somewhere
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.38,1:01:33.93,general text,,0,0,0,,You promised me a new body
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.47,1:01:37.10,general text,,0,0,0,,But instead you turn to stone
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.76,1:01:39.18,general text,,0,0,0,,You are no longer needed
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.85,1:01:42.27,general text,,0,0,0,,And you’ll just turn to stone
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.99,1:01:59.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Bastard...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.22,1:02:20.47,general text,,0,0,0,,When night falls, the magicians will come
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.10,1:02:22.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's see how they make notes?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.73,1:02:24.81,general text,,0,0,0,,They say it’s an amazing sight
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.02,1:02:30.73,general text,,0,0,0,,It would be great, but there will be problems if we get caught
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.82,1:02:31.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go home
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.58,1:02:47.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Kim went wild
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.33,1:02:49.71,general text,,0,0,0,,No one should know that he is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.30,1:02:53.72,general text,,0,0,0,,He is still in Jeonbugwan. We must find him before dawn
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.80,1:02:54.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.39,1:03:39.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I know you are here
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.39,1:03:42.68,general text,,0,0,0,,No need to create problems, come out
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.76,1:03:44.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll give you what you want
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.40,1:03:53.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Come out
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.94,1:03:57.86,general text,,0,0,0,,- Now!\N- I’m leaving
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.91,1:04:04.87,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.42,1:04:12.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.54,1:04:14.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm on an errand
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.30,1:04:15.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, I wanted to watch
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.14,1:04:21.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Order?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.93,1:04:25.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you wanted honey cookies
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.68,1:04:28.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Cookies?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.14,1:04:30.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim noticed that you were upset,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.27,1:04:32.02,general text,,0,0,0,,and asked me to give you some
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.65,1:04:37.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Tell her I'm grateful
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.82,1:04:38.95,italics,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.36,1:04:43.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you would be angry that I entered without permission
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.03,1:04:44.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you angry?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.99,1:04:48.29,general text,,0,0,0,,You came to give me cookies. You can go
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.58,1:04:51.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Good. To be honest...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.13,1:04:54.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.55,1:04:57.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, come out. He's not angry
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.55,1:05:00.47,general text,,0,0,0,,This is my maid
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.01,1:05:03.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Moo Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.89,1:05:05.43,general text,,0,0,0,,his maid
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.97,1:05:09.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You are here too
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.23,1:05:12.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you would be angry
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.31,1:05:15.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your hospitality
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.52,1:05:16.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat cookies
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.90,1:05:19.24,general text,,0,0,0,,If you want more, just tell me
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.99,1:05:23.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.32,1:05:24.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.63,1:05:42.84,memories,,0,0,0,,This is the royal eunuch
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.89,1:05:45.30,memories italics,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.56,1:05:47.97,memories,,0,0,0,,He is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.85,1:05:51.44,memories,,0,0,0,,Look. He went wild
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.40,1:06:01.82,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that the nomad was in the palace
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.90,1:06:02.95,memories,,0,0,0,,Perhaps
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.82,1:06:05.12,memories,,0,0,0,,this is his doing
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.45,1:06:09.83,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I know you are here
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.33,1:06:12.71,memories,,0,0,0,,No need to create problems, come out
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.79,1:06:14.54,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll give you what you want
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.34,1:06:22.76,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.35,1:06:32.60,memories,,0,0,0,,I’m leaving
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.50,1:06:59.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Run
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.84,1:07:04.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Behind us is another door
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.10,1:07:18.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Why won’t you let us go?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.73,1:07:23.82,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s hardly right to let go of a magician who got here so easily
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.90,1:07:26.07,general text,,0,0,0,,You will have problems,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.07,1:07:28.53,general text,,0,0,0,,if I disappear in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:30.08,general text,,0,0,0,,And I will not harm you
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.24,1:07:33.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Your body will be safe
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.96,1:07:43.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Uk...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.61,1:08:48.90,italics,,0,0,0,,You are inside the barrier that I created
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.49,1:08:54.62,italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.49,1:08:57.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Stand still and you won’t get hurt
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.25,1:09:01.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait here
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.72,1:09:16.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Your name was Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.89,1:09:19.85,general text,,0,0,0,,That same maid,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.93,1:09:24.15,general text,,0,0,0,,who is always with him and from whom he is always in trouble
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.40,1:09:29.40,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a person here
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.94,1:09:32.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Go out and restore your energy
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.75,1:09:45.21,general text,,0,0,0,,And then
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.79,1:09:49.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I will move you into the body of the young master, as you wanted
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.69,1:10:05.23,general text,,0,0,0,,This witch... shaman Choi
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.69,1:10:08.82,general text,,0,0,0,,said to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.86,1:10:11.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I need your help
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.57,1:10:15.45,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t believe me, I’ll leave
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.37,1:10:19.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You can have a snack with her
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.25,1:11:12.84,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.77,1:12:10.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, help me again
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.44,1:12:13.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Give your student confidence
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.33,1:12:26.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.62,1:13:07.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.21,1:13:11.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.24,1:13:45.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.77,1:14:14.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.27,1:14:19.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.74,1:14:23.70,general text,,0,0,0,,just drained his energy
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.91,1:14:32.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.75,1:14:35.29,general text,,0,0,0,,running wild?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.64,1:14:51.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mu Dok..\N- Don’t come near
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.95,1:15:06.49,general text,,0,0,0,,No. Everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.24,1:15:08.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.37,1:15:12.20,general text,,0,0,0,,- And you’ll be fine\N- No
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.20,1:15:14.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t touch me
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.33,1:15:17.96,general text,,0,0,0,,If I go wild,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.17,1:15:22.01,general text,,0,0,0,,you better not touch me
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.51,1:15:27.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I will drain your energy too
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.09,1:15:29.22,general text,,0,0,0,,and you will die
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.36,1:17:12.53,preview,,0,0,0,,Some noise was coming from the recording room
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.62,1:17:13.99,preview,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.08,1:17:17.04,preview,,0,0,0,,Are you angry that we turned your friend to stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.12,1:17:19.87,preview,,0,0,0,,You will never leave this place
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.96,1:17:23.00,preview,,0,0,0,,So, this is a member of the Cho family?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.08,1:17:26.92,preview,,0,0,0,,And if her spirit clung to Uka, what then?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.00,1:17:30.93,preview,,0,0,0,,If I had not left you in the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.01,1:17:32.93,preview,,0,0,0,,this wouldn’t happen to you
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.01,1:17:34.43,preview,,0,0,0,,Are you putting your life on the line?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.51,1:17:36.51,preview,,0,0,0,,Offer yourself in return this time
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.60,1:17:38.22,preview,,0,0,0,,I will definitely win tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.31,1:17:40.39,preview,,0,0,0,,I need someone who is sure to win
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.48,1:17:43.06,preview,,0,0,0,,If he is looking for a stone to protect her...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.15,1:17:44.15,preview,,0,0,0,,They can’t be together
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.23,1:17:46.69,preview,,0,0,0,,Everything about you has surfaced
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,

